WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.600
Hi. Meet Swiss.

2
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:13.200
Where did you save that link? That screenshot? That file called, final, final, two?

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Swiss is a pocket knife for your stuff. One click in the menu bar, and boom. There it is.

4
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:26.800
Copy a link. Grab a screenshot. They land in Recent, and one tap keeps them.

5
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:35.000
Every project is a tab. Folders, notes, pictures, links, all living together, like a very tidy family.

6
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:42.200
Total mess? Wave the wand. Poof. Sorted. No wizard hat needed.

7
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:50.300
Connect any Finder folder and work in it like a project. Rename, move, tag. Finder keeps up.

8
00:00:50.600 --> 00:01:00.200
Then, the Frame. A canvas floating above everything. Drop in pictures, notes, links. Oops? Command Z. We've all been there.

9
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:06.100
Pop-up, window, or full screen. One click. Your call.

10
00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:11.700
No account. No cloud. Nobody watching. Just you and your Mac.

11
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:19.500
Swiss. A pocket knife for your ideas. Now go save something.
